# Base URL of the science-agent API server
# (Science-Agent-Pipeline/artifacts/api-server), used by src/lib/api.ts to
# resolve literature-backed simulation parameters (BRENDA/KEGG/PubMed) for
# the terminal's `run kinetics <enzyme>` and `run epidemiology <query>`
# commands. Without this set, those commands report "no literature source
# reachable" rather than fabricating a number -- see docs/CONSTITUTION.md.
#
# Local dev, once api-server is running (cd Science-Agent-Pipeline/artifacts/api-server && pnpm dev):
VITE_TERRIUM_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
